</node>
<node id="Cognitive Impairment and Clinical Dementia Expression">
  <data key="d0">mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">This mechanism captures the disruption of cognitive domains including memory, executive function, language, and processing speed, translating to deficits measurable by neuropsychological tests and functional questionnaires. It directly accounts for the clinical expression and severity assessment of dementia and MCI.</data>
  <data key="d2">55</data>
</node>
