<node id="Neuropsychiatric and Behavioral Dysfunction">
  <data key="d0">mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">Neurodegenerative changes in key brain circuits lead to non-cognitive symptoms such as depression, agitation, apathy, psychosis, sleep disturbances, and altered behavior. These features are prevalent in AD and MCI and can be measured through structured assessments.</data>
  <data key="d2">14</data>
</node>
