</node>
<node id="Vascular and Metabolic Contributions">
  <data key="d0">mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">Vascular health influences cognition through mechanisms such as ischemia, white matter disease, and neurovascular dysfunction, which can coexist or potentiate AD pathology. Blood pressure, BMI, and metabolic state influence risk and progression.</data>
  <data key="d2">6</data>
</node>
