<node id="Demographic and Genetic Risk Modifiers">
  <data key="d0">mechanism</data>
  <data key="d1">Population-based risk factors such as age, education, sex, ethnicity, race, and marital status modulate both risk and progression of AD, potentially through baseline cognitive reserve, socioeconomic factors, and genetic influences.</data>
  <data key="d2">6</data>
</node>
